  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CENTRE FOR RENEWABLE ENERGY AND ACTION ON CLIMATE DISPLACEDPERSONS&apos; LIVELIHOODS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work in four villages in Bungudu area Zamfara to support 400 rural farmers and youth mostly women in regenerative farming, organic home gardening, financial literacy and tree propagation through the establishment of tree nursery beds to help improve food security, biodiversity, and forestry practices in order to contribute in climate change mitigation and adaptation among the rural farmers. Focus is on the communities displaced by conflict and climate change effects.</narrative>
  </description>
